          "canonical_hash": "sha256:453673e13ae5668f4f0e7b79576d505b1e1f32b6e5c726dc5a9e31aa08555210",
          "description": "Ask a question and get an AI-generated answer grounded in the agent's stored memories using Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG). This is useful for synthesizing insights from multiple stored memories into a coherent answer.",
